---
// Footer Component - Apple-style minimal tech blog footer
const currentYear = 2027;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-container">
    <div class="footer-top-row">
      <div class="footer-brand-info">
        <div class="footer-logo">
          <div class="footer-logo-icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M21 16V14L13 9V3.5C13 2.67 12.33 2 11.5 2C10.67 2 10 2.67 10 3.5V9L2 14V16L10 13.5V19L8 20.5V22L11.5 21L15 22V20.5L13 19V13.5L21 16Z" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="footer-brand-title">2027 机场日志 / Airport Journal</span>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-brand-summary">
          专注于机场品牌深度档案、套餐价格、节点分布与实战指南的专业资讯博客。遵循纯静态预渲染技术标准，保障卓越的阅读体验与搜索引擎抓取性能。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links-group">
        <div class="footer-links-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">快速导航</div>
          <ul class="footer-links-list">
            <li><a href="/">网站首页</a></li>
            <li><a href="/archives/">全部机场档案 (17家)</a></li>
            <li><a href="/airports/">品牌索引目录</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/">选购与使用指南</a></li>
            <li><a href="/search/">全站即时搜索</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-links-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">安全与专区</div>
          <ul class="footer-links-list">
            <li><a href="/risk-alerts/" class="footer-alert-link">机场风险预警专区 ⚠</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/#guide-troubleshoot">连接异常三步排查</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/#guide-clients">客户端与订阅导入</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about/">关于本站与免责合作</a></li>
            <li><a href="/sitemap.xml" target="_blank">网站地图 (Sitemap)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom-bar">
      <div class="footer-copyright">
        © {currentYear} 机场日志 (jichangrizhi.blog). 保留所有权利。
      </div>
      <div class="footer-disclaimer-note">
        本站内容基于公开资料与历史核对记录整理，非官方直接平台。2027 为年度规划主题，实际资料以所附核验日期为准。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Floating Back-to-Top Button -->
  <a href="#top" id="backToTopBtn" class="back-to-top" aria-label="返回页面顶部">
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
    </svg>
  </a>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 48px 0 32px 0;
    margin-top: auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .footer-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .footer-top-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-brand-info {
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .footer-logo-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .footer-brand-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-title);
  }

  .footer-brand-summary {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .footer-links-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-col-title {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-title);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .footer-links-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .footer-links-list a {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-body);
    transition: var(--transition-base);
  }

  .footer-links-list a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .footer-alert-link {
    color: #DC2626 !important;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .footer-bottom-bar {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    padding-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .back-to-top {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    color: var(--color-title);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 99;
    transition: var(--transition-base);
    text-decoration: none;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .back-to-top.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .back-to-top:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(40, 92, 240, 0.35);
  }
</style>

<script>
  // Show / hide back-to-top button on scroll
  const backBtn = document.getElementById('backToTopBtn');
  if (backBtn) {
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (window.scrollY > 400) {
        backBtn.classList.add('visible');
      } else {
        backBtn.classList.remove('visible');
      }
    }, { passive: true });
  }
</script>
